WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.911
AegisForge-X makes a security finding
traceable to the source.

00:00:04.265 --> 00:00:07.252
Python masks comments while preserving
positions.

00:00:07.252 --> 00:00:09.685
Language rules flag potential issues,

00:00:09.685 --> 00:00:13.437
and hashes link evidence to the
reviewed input for human inspection.

00:00:13.807 --> 00:00:16.550
Next, use labeled examples to measure
false alarms

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:19.598
and missed cases for each language and
rule.
